<item><title>Muluzi urges Mutharika to adopt economic recovery plan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/muluzi-urges-mutharika-to-adopt-economic-recovery-plan-99a2c0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/muluzi-urges-mutharika-to-adopt-economic-recovery-plan-99a2c0/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The UDF leader says foreign-exchange and fuel shortages, disrupted activity and mounting hardship demand a national response.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:45:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Nyika-Vwaza trust to receive US$4 million for conservation and tourism</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/nyika-vwaza-trust-to-receive-us-4-million-for-conservation-615f5f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/nyika-vwaza-trust-to-receive-us-4-million-for-conservation-615f5f/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The funds come from a US$29.2 million conservation investment announced by the Peace Parks Foundation on November 19.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:32:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
