<item><title>Malawi launches 16 days of action against gender-based violence</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-launches-16-days-of-action-against-gender-based-79b269/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-launches-16-days-of-action-against-gender-based-79b269/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>Two national action plans are intended to protect women and girls, while First Lady Gertrude Mutharika called for stronger safeguards and justice for survivors.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:25:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" length="31502" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Malawi Parliament summons Egenco and Escom over K2.6 billion debt</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-parliament-summons-egenco-and-escom-over-k2-6-64a38f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-parliament-summons-egenco-and-escom-over-k2-6-64a38f/</guid><category>Malawi</category><description>The committee wants Egenco to explain its K2.6 billion payment to outside lawyers and Escom to account for waiting before paying the debt.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:51:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-parliament-summons-egenco-and-escom-over-k2-6-64a38f/share.jpg" length="40608" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mw/malawi-parliament-summons-egenco-and-escom-over-k2-6-64a38f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
